  "name": "Pad Tile",
  "description": "A 2 m deck where pieces wait, its top level with a Roller Tile run's rollers so a run rolls pieces straight on. Weld tiles side by side into one pad (up to 16 x 16 tiles): one store of 500 pieces a tile, stacked 1 m high, 2 m more for each Mast Block on it. Conveyors end at any open edge; Loader Arms and cranes pick and put; F takes the piece you look at.",
